      {
        "id": 2830189,
        "name": "Eileithya Carmenta",
        "username": "Eileithya_Carmenta",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/eileithya_carmenta/{size}/487561_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-01-23T16:12:58.623Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A.I.ko Danuja <img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/blush.png?v=15\" title=\":blush:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":blush:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>A.I helps me find markets with good resell prices close to where I mine. Don’t even have to visit a third-party website. It also tells me which systems to avoid and which ones have the most asteroid belts.<br>\nIt already gave me half a dozen fits for ships and I bought my Skillbooks based on that.<br>\nOf course, I’m only a super-casual player so I won’t be digging deep into the mechanics but those things I mentioned above are the basics and I thought maybe I should know a few things.</p>",
